<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR ROUTINE</view><view class="title">计划</view>
  <view wx:if="{{profile}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">阶段目标</view><view class="row"><text class="label">当前体重</text><input class="input compact" type="digit" value="{{form.current_weight}}" data-key="current_weight" bindinput="onInput" /></view><view class="row"><text class="label">目标体重</text><input class="input compact" type="digit" value="{{form.target_weight}}" data-key="target_weight" bindinput="onInput" /></view><picker mode="date" value="{{form.target_date}}" bindchange="onInput" data-key="target_date"><view class="input">目标日期：{{form.target_date || '暂不设定'}}</view></picker><view class="muted">体重目标可以根据记录和感受定期复盘。</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">每周安排建议</view><view class="muted">安排有氧、力量和休息日，按生活节奏调整。</view><view wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="key" class="row schedule"><text>{{item.name}}</text><picker range="{{weekOptions}}" value="{{item.choice}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="onPlanPick"><view class="pill">{{item.value}}　⌄</view></picker></view><button class="button" bindtap="save">保存新计划</button><view class="muted">安全模式下计划以新增版本保存；历史计划不会被覆盖。</view></view>
</view>
